Version 2.1.1, 13 November 2026
[BUGFIX] Send the report after the page is delivered instead of before; a slow KIscore API no longer delays every page
[BUGFIX] Report page views only: no form submits, HEAD or OPTIONS requests, AJAX and page-type requests, prefetches, error pages or backend previews
[BUGFIX] Keep an unexpected error while preparing the report away from the visitor

Version 2.1.0, 20 October 2026
[FEATURE] Read site ID and tracking secret from one connection key ("Ki-Score Connection Key"); the separate fields keep working
[FEATURE] Show only one masked connection-key field, with English and German labels
[BUGFIX] Reject malformed connection keys without silently using old credentials
[FEATURE] Support TYPO3 14
[FEATURE] Name the extension in the User-Agent of each report (KIscore-TYPO3/2.1.0), so KIscore can show the integration as connected
[BUGFIX] Order the tracking middleware after typo3/cms-frontend/prepare-tsfe-rendering, the identifier the core actually uses

Version 2.0.0, 25 September 2026
[!!!][FEATURE] Send the tracking secret in X-Kiscore-Tracking-Secret; tracking stays off until site ID and secret are configured
[!!!][TASK] Send tracking data to https://api.kiscore.ai/track/ and drop the default site ID
[FEATURE] Send the client IP and the page path with its utm_* parameters, truncated to the API limits

Version 1.0.0, 17 February 2026
[FEATURE] Release of version 1.0.0